{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 7327279524640936130,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Zulip Notifications",
      "source_hash": 8912595176255050677,
      "context_hash": 11089920521836423218,
      "translation": "Zulip 알림",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Zulip": "Zulip"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:48.621317Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Triagebot can send messages to Zulip based on various triggers like issue labels.",
      "source_hash": 11231990808974116581,
      "context_hash": 10257558343736456067,
      "translation": "Triagebot은 이슈 레이블 같은 다양한 트리거에 기반하여 Zulip으로 메시지를 보낼 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot",
        "issue": "이슈",
        "Zulip": "Zulip"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:48.621318Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Usage",
      "source_hash": 8769925957682373409,
      "context_hash": 12896212404956231010,
      "translation": "사용법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:21.853393Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Zulip notifications are automated based on the configuration described below.",
      "source_hash": 5940213933676472888,
      "context_hash": 16054651374794290071,
      "translation": "Zulip 알림은 아래에 설명된 설정에 따라 자동화되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Zulip": "Zulip"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:48.621318Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "They can be triggered based on the addition or removal of labels, or when an issue is closed or reopened.",
      "source_hash": 6508399408231264196,
      "context_hash": 3322210136907403175,
      "translation": "라벨의 추가나 제거, 또는 이슈가 닫히거나 다시 열릴 때 트리거될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:21.853393Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "For example, the `rust-lang/rust` repository is configured to automatically post a message whenever an issue is tagged with the `A-edition-2021` label to the \"Edition 2021\" stream, which looks something like:",
      "source_hash": 18144818366124942896,
      "context_hash": 685439457453775518,
      "translation": "예를 들어, `rust-lang/rust` 저장소는 이슈에 `A-edition-2021` 레이블이 지정될 때마다 \"Edition 2021\" 스트림에 자동으로 메시지를 게시하도록 구성되어 있으며, 에디션과 관련된 이 알림은 대략 다음과 같은 모습입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈",
        "label": "레이블",
        "edition": "에디션"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:48.621319Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "triagebot",
      "source_hash": 15904986654751003533,
      "context_hash": 5306768537168043560,
      "translation": "triagebot",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:48.621319Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Issue [#109298](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/109298) \"ICE `Subslice unexpected because it isn't captured` --edition=2021\" has been added.",
      "source_hash": 13261252940647437057,
      "context_hash": 11245658885736251499,
      "translation": "이슈 [#109298](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/109298) \"ICE `Subslice unexpected because it isn't captured` --edition=2021\"이 추가되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "edition": "에디션",
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:21.853395Z",
      "issues": [
        "Term 'edition' should be translated as '에디션' but was not found in translation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 13038762797767954725,
      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:21.853396Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This feature is enabled on a repository by having a `[notify-zulip]` table in `triagebot.toml`.",
      "source_hash": 10661803189001381800,
      "context_hash": 16622683766626967805,
      "translation": "이 기능은 `triagebot.toml`에 `[notify-zulip]` 테이블을 두어 저장소에서 활성화합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:21.853396Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Some of the messages support substitutions:",
      "source_hash": 15750557097234382891,
      "context_hash": 2932723435403716138,
      "translation": "일부 메시지는 치환을 지원합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:21.853396Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`{number}` is replaced with the issue/PR number.",
      "source_hash": 11281999287011338570,
      "context_hash": 5871789211469771918,
      "translation": "`{number}`는 이슈/PR 번호로 대체됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:21.853397Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`{title}` is replaced with the issue/PR title.",
      "source_hash": 13878158793008958386,
      "context_hash": 360730390750020423,
      "translation": "`{title}`은 이슈/PR 제목으로 대체됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:21.853397Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`{recipients}` is replaced with a list of mentions of the people involved in the issue/PR: the author and the assignees.",
      "source_hash": 14804051287797024950,
      "context_hash": 6521180389304671973,
      "translation": "`{recipients}`는 이슈/PR에 관련된 사람들(작성자와 담당자)의 멘션 목록으로 대체됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:21.853397Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 10635127114739636215,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:21.853398Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [`src/handlers/notify_zulip.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/notify_zulip.rs).",
      "source_hash": 14715471393330176561,
      "context_hash": 5801226501789644448,
      "translation": "[`src/handlers/notify_zulip.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/notify_zulip.rs)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:21.853398Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}